<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung says no new development on Fokker.</title>
<headline>Samsung says no new development on Fokker.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Aerospace Industries Co said on Tuesday there had been no new development in its bid to take over Dutch planemaker Fokker NV.</p>
<p>&quot;There have been no new developments recently, but the deal is still alive,&quot; said Park Jong-hyun, a manager at Samsung's public relations department. &quot;It's true that we have run into difficulties, but we have never dropped our bid.&quot;</p>
<p>Samsung Aerospace is a unit of Samsung Group.</p>
</text>
